login computers: channel name

When we install AD DS (Active Directory domain service) in server OS that machine become Domain Controller.

AD DS is a service developed by Microsoft.

Install Microsoft server edition like 2012R2, 2016,2019,2022 on server.
Install service which is known as AD DS

DC is resposible to check authentication. If any user trying to logging in system in network, request goes to DC, DC will check if that username and password is present in DB (reside in AD) or not.

IF it is, DC authenticates and allow user to login over a network.

Centralized management of network resources such as users, computers, printers, group

If user forget his password, then you can reset password on server itself through DC

Using DC, we deploy software utilities on network. Eg I want to install chrome on computers. The one way is to do manually but if I have 50 PC's, then this concept occurs when user login.

Manage Group Policy which is applied on user, PC's through AD
like policies appplied on desktop, wallpaper
block control panel
